WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:15.894
it was a long time in coming after an exceptionally lengthy and dreary winter, spring finally arrived.

2
00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:22.717
For the March girls, springtime signaled new beginnings, new opportunities, and new dreams.

3
00:00:23.777 --> 00:00:29.159
Meg was already off to a good start that season, having been invited to several parties hosted by

4
00:00:29.219 --> 00:00:30.200
her wealthy friends.

5
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.041
"What shall I wear?"

6
00:00:32.441 --> 00:00:34.523
was her most frequent complaint lately.

7
00:00:35.743 --> 00:00:40.006
Looking through the closet, Meg pulled out a light green dress and held it up to her body.

8
00:00:40.847 --> 00:00:45.810
Through the mirror, she could see that it suited her complexion and enhanced the color of her eyes.

9
00:00:46.611 --> 00:00:50.273
But the dress was quite a few years old, and its hem was worn.

10
00:00:50.293 --> 00:00:52.675
"Oh, what should I do?"

11
00:00:53.275 --> 00:00:55.357
Meg let out a sigh of frustration.

12
00:00:57.738 --> 00:00:58.899
"What's the matter, Meg?"

13
00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:02.233
asked Beth, walking in with an armful of folded laundry.

14
00:01:02.993 --> 00:01:08.476
Relieving her of some of the burden, Meg explained, "Annie Moffat is having a party this Saturday and

15
00:01:08.576 --> 00:01:10.136
I haven't got anything to wear."

16
00:01:11.257 --> 00:01:15.399
Beth replied thoughtfully, "You have many beautiful dresses, Meg."

17
00:01:15.419 --> 00:01:17.760
"But they're so old!"

18
00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:18.940
complained Meg.

19
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.683
"Annie and the others will all have new silk dresses in this year's style, and I'll be the

20
00:01:24.863 --> 00:01:27.264
only one wearing an old, ugly dress."

21
00:01:28.344 --> 00:01:32.986
"I think you'll be the prettiest girl at the party, whatever you wear," Beth remarked.

22
00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:39.369
Cheering up a little at her sister's kind words, Meg continued with Beth's help to search for something

23
00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:39.789
to wear.

24
00:01:39.809 --> 00:01:42.170
"What about this dress?"

25
00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:46.132
Beth asked, pulling out a white gown with blue flowers all over it.

26
00:01:46.992 --> 00:01:51.414
Meg examined it closely for rips, holes, or stains but could not find any.

27
00:01:52.214 --> 00:01:56.016
In fact, the dress was in tip-top condition and it did flatter her a lot.

28
00:01:56.812 --> 00:01:57.532
"Thank you, Beth.

29
00:01:57.912 --> 00:02:01.113
This dress will have to do," Meg approved wholeheartedly.

30
00:02:02.694 --> 00:02:05.055
The much-anticipated evening was soon upon them.

31
00:02:06.035 --> 00:02:11.056
Leaving Meg to get ready for her big night, Jo and the others amused themselves by doing what

32
00:02:11.116 --> 00:02:17.979
they loved most: Jo was reading a novel (another one "borrowed" from Aunt March), Beth was playing the

33
00:02:18.019 --> 00:02:21.460
piano, and Amy was drawing a picture of one of Mr.

34
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.360
Laurence's horses.

35
00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.181
"Has Meg come down yet?"

36
00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:29.425
Mother asked as she strolled into the living room, holding a velvet jewelry box.

37
00:02:30.285 --> 00:02:35.930
Shaking her head disapprovingly, Jo replied, "I don't know why it takes so long to get ready.

38
00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.133
Just throw the dress on, slip into your shoes, and you're good to go."

39
00:02:41.134 --> 00:02:48.160
Rolling her eyes, Amy said, "That's the difference between looking like a lady, and looking well just unladylike."

40
00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.141
"How do I look, girls?"

41
00:02:50.642 --> 00:02:53.024
Meg floated in while her sisters were talking.

42
00:02:53.776 --> 00:02:59.440
They all, including Jo, sucked in their breath, for Meg looked like an enchanted fairy princess.

43
00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:07.005
"You look positively beautiful," complimented Mother, smiling approvingly at her eldest daughter.

44
00:03:07.025 --> 00:03:12.629
"Oh, Meg, all the men at the party will want to dance with you," gushed Amy.

45
00:03:12.649 --> 00:03:19.614
"Just be careful with your heels this time," Jo said jokingly, reminding Meg of the last party they

46
00:03:19.654 --> 00:03:20.454
attended together.

47
00:03:21.415 --> 00:03:23.016
Laughing, Meg promised she would.

48
00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:29.880
"I thought tonight would be a proper occasion for you to wear this," said Mother, opening the jewelry

49
00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.781
box and taking out a string of pearls.

50
00:03:32.742 --> 00:03:34.623
She put them around Meg's slim neck.

51
00:03:35.464 --> 00:03:36.164
"Oh, Mother!

52
00:03:36.525 --> 00:03:37.525
They're perfect!"

53
00:03:38.046 --> 00:03:39.767
Meg's cheeks flushed with delight.

54
00:03:39.787 --> 00:03:42.749
"I feel like the most beautiful girl in the world."

55
00:03:43.689 --> 00:03:47.752
Saying good-bye to her family, Meg left for Annie's house in high spirits.

56
00:03:49.453 --> 00:03:53.096
When Meg got to Annie's house, however, her mood rapidly faded.

57
00:03:54.344 --> 00:03:59.807
At home, Meg may have been the radiant princess but among her friends, she felt like a farm

58
00:03:59.847 --> 00:04:01.428
girl on her way to milk the cows.

59
00:04:01.448 --> 00:04:09.113
"Meg, you look so charming," was Annie's forced comment when she opened the door.

60
00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:11.174
"I like your hair.

61
00:04:11.474 --> 00:04:12.735
Did you do it yourself?"

62
00:04:13.175 --> 00:04:15.216
Sallie asked a little too sweetly.

63
00:04:16.017 --> 00:04:20.679
Meg touched the curls on her head and nodded shyly, trying hard not to stare at her what

64
00:04:20.719 --> 00:04:21.680
her friends were wearing.

65
00:04:22.576 --> 00:04:29.498
Just as she suspected, Annie, Sallie, and Annie's sister Belle were all wearing silk dresses in pastel spring

66
00:04:29.538 --> 00:04:35.640
colors. Their hair was perfectly pulled back into a high bun with two curls hanging down the side

67
00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:36.240
of each cheek.

68
00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.241
Meg also noticed that her friends wore make-up on their lips, eyes, and cheeks.

69
00:04:42.242 --> 00:04:44.442
They looked sophisticated and very elegant.

70
00:04:45.243 --> 00:04:49.964
While Annie led her inside the house, Meg noticed Sallie and Belle whispering to each other.

71
00:04:51.884 --> 00:04:55.426
"Meg," Sallie said in a cheery voice as she took Meg's arm.

72
00:04:56.646 --> 00:05:01.508
"You have the most beautiful eyes and I think if you had just a little bit of color

73
00:05:01.548 --> 00:05:03.409
there, they would stand out even more."

74
00:05:03.429 --> 00:05:06.530
"I don't know," Meg said hesitantly.

75
00:05:07.391 --> 00:05:09.692
Mother did not approve of her girls wearing make-up.

76
00:05:09.712 --> 00:05:11.413
"It'll be fun!

77
00:05:11.993 --> 00:05:15.114
And you'll look even prettier," Annie tried to persuade her.

78
00:05:15.134 --> 00:05:17.375
"We're all wearing some.

79
00:05:17.735 --> 00:05:19.176
Don't you think we look nice?"

80
00:05:19.536 --> 00:05:21.598
Sallie pushed her face up closer to Meg.

81
00:05:22.499 --> 00:05:25.181
Meg had to admit her friends looked very lovely.

82
00:05:25.201 --> 00:05:29.385
"Well, maybe just a little then," she said, giving in.

83
00:05:30.206 --> 00:05:33.369
Chattering excitedly, the four girls hurried up the stairs, giggling.

84
00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.994
While Belle applied Meg's make-up, Sallie decided to change Meg's hair.

85
00:05:40.095 --> 00:05:45.319
Even before Meg could protest, Sallie swiftly pulled out the pins in her hair and brushed out the

86
00:05:45.359 --> 00:05:49.445
curls. "Your hair was lovely, but a little old-fashioned.

87
00:05:49.945 --> 00:05:55.146
I think this style will suit you even better," Sallie said as she pulled, curled, and twisted Meg's

88
00:05:55.186 --> 00:05:55.987
hair into a bun.

89
00:05:56.007 --> 00:06:02.068
"And your dress, which I love," Annie added rather hastily, "makes your skin look dull.

90
00:06:02.168 --> 00:06:04.129
But I think this one will make you glow!"

91
00:06:05.049 --> 00:06:10.290
Meg immediately fell in love with the bright blue silk dress Annie held up, but pride stopped her

92
00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:10.931
from admitting it.

93
00:06:10.951 --> 00:06:15.912
"I think what I am wearing suits me fine, thank you," she replied graciously.

94
00:06:16.784 --> 00:06:20.167
"Just try it on and see how it looks," begged her friends.

95
00:06:21.168 --> 00:06:26.472
Not wanting to disappoint them, Meg changed out of her old cotton dress and into the shiny silk

96
00:06:26.592 --> 00:06:32.577
one. Almost at once, she felt the difference as the soft silk wrapped around her body.

97
00:06:33.378 --> 00:06:37.862
She suddenly stood up taller, held her head higher, and felt more confident.

98
00:06:39.022 --> 00:06:43.866
After a few added touches to Meg's hair and make-up, Annie placed her hands on Meg's shoulders and

99
00:06:43.927 --> 00:06:45.468
turned her around to face the mirror.

100
00:06:47.016 --> 00:06:51.580
Meg gasped when she saw her reflection, for the face that stared back at her was not a

101
00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.642
farm girl's but a sophisticated young lady's.

102
00:06:54.662 --> 00:06:58.866
"Oh, Meg, please wear this dress tonight!"

103
00:06:59.066 --> 00:06:59.667
cried Annie.

104
00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:02.529
"Look at your amazing eyes and lips!"

105
00:07:02.889 --> 00:07:03.730
Belle pointed out.

106
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.473
"Meg, look at how your hair enhances your cheekbones!"

107
00:07:07.733 --> 00:07:08.394
said Sallie.

108
00:07:09.455 --> 00:07:14.919
So finally Meg gave in to persuasion and agreed to wear the dress, make-up, and hairstyle her friends

109
00:07:14.959 --> 00:07:15.840
had chosen for her.

110
00:07:16.652 --> 00:07:21.279
Grabbing hands, the four friends jumped up and down excitedly complimenting one another.

111
00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.385
Meg felt so proud to be a part of this exclusive group.

112
00:07:26.206 --> 00:07:30.012
Still holding hands, the girls walked down to the party that awaited them.
